/P 24 0 R
/E (Developed a book waqf website system called WAJIT which aims to provide a digital platform that makes for the public to participate in book waqf more easily, organized, and accountably by involving 3 main roles: users, admins, and super admins. Features provided by this system include a unique ID for each waqf transaction and book request, a transaction history that can be accessed and downloaded, a constantly updated book showcase, and a digital certificate that supports the transparency of the book waqf process. In this project, my contributions included frontend website admin development, feature implementation, and design slicing using NextJS.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [13]
>>
